    313  0d8c							; RESTORE (top B of the overlay) is a command key. For testing, for now:
    314  0d8c							;   single tap: white border blink, count it, downbeat re-sync to the Game
    315  0d8c							;		 Boy (its header blinks the beat)
    316  0d8c							;   double tap (second press within DOUBLE_TAP ms): red border blink, count
    317  0d8c							;		 it, switch the Game Boy's screen off / on (CC 112)
